{"ref":"BDB, מִמְשָׁל²","hw":"מִמְשָׁל²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִמְשָׁל</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>dominion, ruler</strong> (late);—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:3\" href=\"/Daniel.11.3\">Dn 11:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:5\" href=\"/Daniel.11.5\">5</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמִּמְשָׁלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.6\">1 Ch 26:6</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ רב</span> <em>great dominion</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:3\" href=\"/Daniel.11.3\">Dn 11:3</a> (acc. cogn. c. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָשַׁל</span>), v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:5\" href=\"/Daniel.11.5\">5</a> (pred. of <span dir=\"rtl\">מֶמְשַׁלְתּוֹ</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  abstr. for concr. (pl.) = <em>rulers</em> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.6\">1 Ch 26:6</a> (? read <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמּשְׁלִים</span>).","next":"BDB, מֶמְשָׁלָה","prev":"BDB, מֹ֫שֶׁל²"}